# North Star

Before starting any work, read `GOAL.md` in the project root. It contains:

- The current north-star goal and definition of done
- Hard constraints (stack, AI provider, storage, security, git)
- An ordered backlog -- work on only the top unchecked item
- A loop protocol for how to execute each run
- A "Current State" section to update after each run

Always follow the loop protocol and constraints defined there.
